{
  "id": "E121",
  "title": "Drinking Tea and Chatting",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-06-04",
  "synopsis": "What kind of tea do Chinese people drink normally?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/435/fe1f3d45077a95a8fdc7e3395c9eb0e3f4aeafc0.mp3?1496073911",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "喝茶聊天\n\n在茶座里\n丹丹：你平常喝什么茶？\n圆圆：我喜欢喝绿茶，比如龙井啊，碧螺春啊。\n丹丹：不过，这里貌似没有这么好的茶。\n圆圆：没关系，喝点普通的就好了。花茶也可以啊！\n丹丹：我就喜欢喝花茶，比如菊花茶、茉莉花茶什么的。\n圆圆：那今天我们就泡茉莉花茶吧。\n丹丹：来，我给你倒点水！",
    "traditional": "喝茶聊天\n\n在茶座裡\n丹丹：你平常喝什麼茶？\n圓圓：我喜歡喝綠茶，比如龍井啊，碧螺春啊。\n丹丹：不過，這裡貌似沒有這麼好的茶。\n圓圓：沒關係，喝點普通的就好了。花茶也可以啊！\n丹丹：我就喜歡喝花茶，比如菊花茶、茉莉花茶甚麼的。\n圓圓：那今天我們就泡茉莉花茶吧。\n丹丹：來，我給你倒點水！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drinking tea and chatting"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在茶座里",
      "traditional": "在茶座裡",
      "pinyin": "zài chá zuò lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In the tea house"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丹丹：你平常喝什么茶？",
      "traditional": "丹丹：你平常喝什麼茶？",
      "pinyin": "dān dān nǐ píng cháng hē shén me chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: What tea do you usually drink?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我喜欢喝绿茶，比如龙井啊，碧螺春啊。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我喜歡喝綠茶，比如龍井啊，碧螺春啊。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ xǐ huan hē lǜ chá bǐ rú lóng jǐng a bì luó chūn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I like green tea, such as Longjing tea and Biluochun tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丹丹：不过，这里貌似没有这么好的茶。",
      "traditional": "丹丹：不過，這裡貌似沒有這麼好的茶。",
      "pinyin": "dān dān bú guò zhè lǐ mào sì méi yǒu zhè me hǎo de chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: However, it seems there is no such good tea here."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "圆圆：没关系，喝点普通的就好了。花茶也可以啊！",
      "traditional": "圓圓：沒關係，喝點普通的就好了。花茶也可以啊！",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán méi guān xi hē diǎn pǔ tōng de jiù hǎo le huā chá yě kě yǐ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: No worries. Normal one is fine. Scented tea would also be good!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丹丹：我就喜欢喝花茶，比如菊花茶、茉莉花茶什么的。",
      "traditional": "丹丹：我就喜歡喝花茶，比如菊花茶、茉莉花茶甚麼的。",
      "pinyin": "dān dān wǒ jiù xǐ huan hē huā chá bǐ rú jú huā chá mò li huā chá shén me de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: I like scented tea! Such as chrysanthemum tea and jasmine tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "圆圆：那今天我们就泡茉莉花茶吧。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：那今天我們就泡茉莉花茶吧。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán nà jīn tiān wǒ men jiù pào mò li huā chá ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Then let’s have some jasmine tea today!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丹丹：来，我给你倒点水！",
      "traditional": "丹丹：來，我給你倒點水！",
      "pinyin": "dān dān lái wǒ gěi nǐ dào diǎn shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dandan: Ok! Let me pour you some water."
    }
  ],
